# SDD: Language and Runtime Gap Policy
status: draft
authority: migration-language-gap

## Principle
Do not emulate React. Model reusable UI semantics natively.

## Investigate first-class support for
- typed component parameters/props
- slots/content
- variants
- state
- events
- conditional/repeated rendering
- semantic attributes and ARIA
- keyboard/focus primitives
- overlays/portals
- form state and validation
- reusable semantic style tokens
- animation/reduced-motion
- responsive behavior

## Every language extension requires
- grammar spec
- parser tests
- AST tests
- invalid syntax tests
- renderer/runtime tests
- backwards-compatibility analysis
- executable `.cronus` example
- LANGUAGE.md update after implementation is real

## Prohibited shortcuts
- arbitrary embedded JS as universal escape hatch
- one special keyword per React component without reusable semantics
- documentation-only features marked as implemented
